0000034C: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 12F3 3EAD 0082 009A 38E6 0463 3EB5 0098 008E 020F 014D 02B7 2A97 3EC2 042B 0463 3EC8 0468 0082 FFFF 3E75 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Ah, Bravery ! I admire your fearlessness , Commander . You take such risks with your index finger !"
