000007F0: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 413A 413F 4143 1960 0475 16CD 0980 4149 0129 0CD7 0961 0CE1 4150 010F 375D 3D8A 034F 411B 0088 020F FFFF 406A ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "YES! HOW 'BOUT THAT !!! But I'm afraid the first one was wrong. Don't ever click on \"CONTEST\" again ."
