00000931: MENU 0001 4204 420A 4214 3E99 421D 4226 422D 0FAC 4233 ; talk | speed | telephone | keyboard | mouse | joystick | screen | CDROM | music | sounds
00000948: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 014D 0B49 00CF 4204 062B 0463 0E77 01DF 2939 423A 0098 05C4 0BCE 4242 0129 4249 020F 023C 0098 01CC 0DEB 0B49 00CF 4253 0514 02BC 16A2 01FE 4258 0062 FFFF 4204 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You want to speed up your computer ? No prob... , I'll just double the frequency . Uh , you may want to move back a couple of yards ..."
00000990: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 023C 023F 0062 1542 0E77 425E 02B7 011A 0062 013F 00AD 00CF 4264 0062 426C 4276 027A 427C 1BC5 13C8 427F 0062 185E 1BC9 1A74 0475 FFFF 4204 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Uh oh ... Your computer can't take it ... It's about to implode ... DANGER... THROW YOUR PC OUT THE WINDOW ... DO IT NOW !!!"
000009D0: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 4286 0082 02E9 02BC 1E35 0ED9 0062 009A 2F49 00CF 428B 0129 12D1 2626 014D 4290 1594 00CF 0CC5 00B3 00CF 089F 08F7 0098 0201 01CC 04D5 020B 0062 FFFF 4204 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Phew ! You're a lucky person ... I managed to save the day .. You might care to mention that to Cap'n Bob , when you see him ..."
00000A16: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 050C 4296 0129 1046 429D 01FE 0463 1C24 42A2 0098 42A8 0463 42AD 042B 02BC 42BA 01FE 42BF 020F 3866 42C8 42D0 0098 42DD 42E6 0DEB 00D2 42EF 0062 FFFF 420A ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "To modify the ring tone of your onboard phone , stab your loudspeakers with a pair of scissors . For further modification , repeated stabbing may be necessary ..."
00000A5C: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 050C 3D81 0463 4214 0098 42F9 0100 4300 4307 042B 3561 430C 4317 0062 FFFF 4214 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "To optimize your keyboard , gouge out excess keys with any commercial screwdriver ..."
00000A84: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 3866 02BC 04F9 4323 3E99 0098 0BCE 432B 0129 0CEC 3E99 4333 042B 02BC 4338 26CF 020F 2732 4340 FFFF 3E99 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "For a more playful mouse , just replace the little mouse ball with a 6-sided die . Thanks Honk!!!"
00000AB6: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 057F 0584 02BC 11DD 41C0 0098 008E 0475 4348 00B3 434C 0CEC 421D 0514 0C68 011A 0D05 0519 0082 FFFF 421D ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "This is a family game , Commander !!! Put that nasty little joystick back where it came from !"
00000AE8: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 3866 4352 435A 00EF 4360 0098 4369 034F 0463 2683 00EF 40C9 1D3D 034F 436E 126E 020F 044D 2F2C 3ED6 0857 0098 24F7 4377 01CC 0211 3FC9 437F 0519 4386 438C 4394 0062 FFFF 4226 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "For sharper color and contrast , spit on your glasses and wipe them on somebody else . If everything looks green , that's because you are under attack from alien vampire cabbages ..."
00000B36: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 10D0 0463 422D 0584 037D 0990 439D 0062 0B41 036E 009A 1278 01DF 0062 1DE0 09BB 0098 2498 02BC 43A2 43AB 144A 2620 0D37 2D7F 43AF 0527 FFFF 422D ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "So your CDROM is way too slow ... What can I say ? ... Next time , buy a circular saw or maybe an electric toothbrush ...."
00000B78: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 014D 2F21 0129 0FAC 0082 0378 1F6A 0479 00CF 43BA 020F 1273 43BE 43C2 43CB 43CF 00EF 43D5 2764 0129 43DA 020F 0A2A 0553 0098 3CD3 011A 01DF FFFF 0FAC ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You hate the music ! That one's easy to fix . Just hit \"CONTROL ALT DEL\", and flip over the CD . That's better , isn't it ?"
