00000C42: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 1010 2769 4442 4450 0062 0A2A 02BC 3A49 03EE 02BC 4458 4461 0098 008E 020F FFFF 4412 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "A free psychotherapy session ... That's a once in a lifetime offer , Commander ."
