00000D14: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 283E 0082 283E 0082 0378 0CE1 0463 4242 2C21 0062 02E9 0984 0129 095C 0961 0098 008E 020F 44BD 04D5 44C0 44C6 020F 08BD 036E 05CF 01CC 042B 00B3 0062 FFFF 441A ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Ha ! Ha ! That was your double talking ... You're not the only one , Commander . Go see Super ZEN . He can help you with that ..."
00000D5C: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 014D 011D 0572 2E83 02BC 0ED9 0098 0BB0 0873 2C17 0098 401E 02BC 0CEC 44CA 0098 153C 01DF 0062 FFFF 441A ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You think you're quite a person , but deep down , there's a little child , right ? ..."
00000D8E: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 1D31 02BC 44D0 03EE 01CC 0098 008E 0062 FFFF 441A ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "There's a rebel in you , Commander ..."
00000DAA: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 44D6 0062 03D1 3FF0 0381 0129 44DE 44E5 0062 014D 0BCE 25CC 089F 08F7 0062 FFFF 4424 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Careful ... You'll never get the stains ou ... You just ask Cap'n Bob ..."
