00000DF4: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0184 0098 01CC 044A 0980 3EF7 0098 008E 0062 FFFF 267A ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Yes , you !! I'm impressed , Commander ..."
00000E12: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0980 43E3 450D 4515 03EE 0129 3AD6 3F1F 01FE 0463 153C 3F26 0062 FFFF 443B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "I'm sensing strange pulsions in the B cortex of your right hemisphere ..."
00000E38: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 05E4 451E 0584 02BC 4527 4530 00CF 4536 020F 10D0 04B7 2D75 0062 12E9 089F 08F7 00D2 0D37 453D 0062 FFFF 443B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Commander, chastity is a stepping stone to wisdom . So stay calm ... Let Cap'n Bob be an example ..."
00000E6C: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 4545 454B 036E 00D2 3693 00EF 4552 020F 0622 0984 1786 0385 2711 01DF FFFF 443B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Space travel can be long and lonely . Why not watch some TV ?"
00000E94: TEXT 0872 FF 61 80 - - 2ED0 0082 0395 4559 0062 FFFF 443B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Ahh ! The ondoyants ..."
