00001109: TEXT 0872 FF 61 80 - - 4653 00AD 1265 03EE 4660 0098 008E 01DF FFFF 0B56 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Explanations about anything in particular , Commander ?"
