0000114B: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 089F 08F7 0584 226C 3138 020F 08BD 4672 0BF3 17EC 0062 FFFF 462F ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob is our master . He built us all ..."
0000116D: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 089F 08F7 0584 0194 0194 10A0 0098 008E 020F 4595 4678 0C42 10A0 0062 FFFF 462F ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob is very very old , Commander . Over 800,000 years old ..."
00001195: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 089F 08F7 4680 0447 00CF 3F09 0C2A 34F0 468B 0211 226C 4691 00CF 0129 4699 469D 0062 FFFF 462F ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob programmed me to detect black holes which are our gateway to the BIG BANG ..."
000011C3: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 089F 08F7 0584 0194 0194 00E3 020F 08BD 066D 02BC 46A2 0098 0BCE 0437 01CC 020F 0980 02BC 0490 0062 FFFF 462F ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob is very very intelligent . He has a biobrain , just like you . I'm a cybernetic ..."
000011F7: TEXT 0872 FF 61 80 - - 009A 46AB 1634 46B0 0098 0913 0062 FFFF 17B5 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "I HEAR AND OBEY , COMMANDER ..."
00001211: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0395 249C 0584 226C 1456 0098 4672 12C6 0490 46B5 46BB 00CF 46C5 46CC FFFF 0B19 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The ARK is our vessel , built by cybernetic units belonging to KANARY CORP."
00001239: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 013F 2E83 02BC 2AB1 0082 028F 090E 46D2 46D5 0C68 090B 036E 46DF 46E5 144A 46EC 0062 FFFF 0B19 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "It's quite a ship ! We have 16 CRYOBOXES where we can stock aliens or merchandise ..."
00001267: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0395 0B19 0584 46F8 042B 0129 4701 4708 470D 03EE 0129 0E45 3E0D 0062 FFFF 0B19 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The Ark is equipped with the fasted warp drives in the entire universe ..."
0000128F: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0395 0B19 0584 46F8 042B 0D37 4714 4719 0F5B 471F 0062 0395 1E14 0211 4161 4722 0062 FFFF 0B19 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The Ark is equipped with an ORXX layer called MA ... The Orxx are amazing missiles ..."
000012BD: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 30AC 1C24 472B 090E 1305 4734 020F 028F 090E 0129 420A 0098 02BC 473D 00EF 4748 2711 0062 FFFF 0B19 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "All onboard comforts have been provided . We have the telephone , a restaurant and widescreen TV ..."
000012ED: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 471F 0584 0961 01FE 4753 475C 0098 02BC 3E94 01FE 2060 4768 0098 476E 477A 12C6 089F 08F7 0062 FFFF 463B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA is one of nature's curiosities , a kind of space whale , genetically altered by Cap'n Bob ..."
0000131F: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 471F 4782 0FE4 4787 03EE 0129 478C 4791 0395 4787 4797 04E7 4714 0062 FFFF 463B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA lays her eggs in the PRAM ZONE. The eggs hatch into ORXX ..."
00001347: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 471F 0584 02BC 479D 1754 0098 008E 020F 0DB7 0584 0194 479D 00CF 0FAC 0062 FFFF 471F ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA is a sensitive being , Commander . She is very sensitive to music ..."
00001371: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 471F 47A7 095C 47AC 47B6 0062 FFFF 463B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA eats only synthetic strawberries ..."
00001389: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 089F 08F7 0AC6 47AC 47B6 020F 08BD 47C3 1D3D 042B 05CF 0519 0129 46C5 47CD FFFF 463B ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob loves synthetic strawberries . He perfected them with help from the KANARY geneticists."
000013B3: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 1E14 0211 47DA 47E1 4722 020F 2732 00CF 1D3D 0098 0572 2979 052C 47E8 0062 FFFF 1E14 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Orxx are LIVING guided missiles . Thanks to them , you're always perfectly safe ..."
000013DD: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 014D 47ED 0D37 1E14 05AA 47F3 47FA 05AA 0817 4801 0609 4807 034F 3956 0292 01CC 0062 FFFF 1E14 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You guide an Orxx through space, seeing through its eyes. It lands on planets for you ..."
0000140B: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 044D 401E 3561 480D 0098 0129 1E14 0584 118C 0062 05D4 01CC 0082 02E9 47E8 03EE 4814 0062 FFFF 1E14 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "If there's any danger , the Orxx is destroyed ... Not you ! You're safe in orbit ..."
0000143B: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 4488 01FE 1E14 047E 0463 481A 020F 028F 3D90 05AA 1D3D 042B 0129 46E5 020F 482A 4830 0211 483A 12C6 4845 0129 1C24 3DF5 0062 FFFF 1E14 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Think of Orxx as your representatives . We dialog through them with the aliens . Alien languages are translated by Olga, the onboard translator ..."
00001479: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0395 1E14 0211 0961 01FE 089F 08A5 484B 4852 0062 FFFF 1E14 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The Orxx are one of Cap'n Bob's finest creations ..."
00001499: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 15F9 0584 226C 0490 3DF5 020F 0DB7 09F9 17EC 0129 4830 03EE 0129 3E0D 0062 FFFF 15F9 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Olga is our cybernetic translator . She knows all the languages in the universe ..."
000014C3: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 15F9 0584 0194 485C 09C0 03EE 1645 020F 04EC 1260 0447 0098 008E 0062 FFFF 15F9 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Olga is very highly paid in MEGAWATTS . More than me , Commander ..."
000014EB: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 15F9 4863 486E 0E32 0292 0E32 020F 0DB7 22EC 1594 0292 434C 2E31 0062 FFFF 15F9 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Olga translates almost word for word . She doesn't care for nasty language ..."
00001513: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 4875 1278 1265 070B 00AD 15F9 0098 008E 020F 3E16 0194 487B 0062 FFFF 15F9 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Never say anything bad about Olga , Commander . She's very touchy ..."
00001539: TEXT 0872 FF 40 80 - - 4882 127C 4889 488D 4892 2FB7 4897 489D 48A3 1CF5 15F9 0527 FFFF 15F9 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x40,0x80 "MISTER HONK CAN JUST SHUT HIS LYING MOUTH ..... SIGNED Olga ...."
0000155D: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0BCA 089A 009A 250F 0098 008E 0062 009A 0BEE 01CC 0062 FFFF 15F9 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "See what I mean , Commander ... I told you ..."
0000157F: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0395 4699 469D 0584 0961 01FE 089F 08A5 48A9 0098 008E 020F 08BD 48B4 0129 4699 469D 0CD2 05CF 020B 03D8 0129 3E0D 0062 48BB 48BF 22EC 48C3 020B 0062 FFFF 463E ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The BIG BANG is one of Cap'n Bob's inventions , Commander . He thinks the BIG BANG will help him understand the universe ... Old age doesn't suit him ..."
000015C7: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 0595 48C8 0206 0447 0129 4699 469D 0584 48D5 0098 008E 020F 009A 011D 1855 02BC 48DA 48E3 48E9 00CF 48F2 0BF3 0062 FFFF 463E ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "My calculations tell me the BIG BANG is fake , Commander . I think it's a deformed prism designed to fool us ..."
00001601: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 05E4 0BCE 45F7 01CC 00EF 0447 0098 009A 011D 08CC 1F78 1F80 08F7 066D 0E61 2A9C 03EE 1F4D 0062 FFFF 463E ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Commander, just between you and me , I think ol' Buzzard Man Bob has another idea in mind ..."
00001633: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 48F7 34F0 0211 4161 48FD 468B 2060 0100 09BB 00EF 4905 2060 0062 FFFF 4647 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Black holes are amazing devices which space out time and temporize space ..."
00001659: TEXT 0872 FF 60 80 - - 044D 090B 454B 05AA 02BC 0C2A 0C30 0098 090B 0211 0994 00CF 490F 1FA2 00EF 4918 491E 0098 008E 0062 FFFF 4647 ; TEXT line=0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "If we travel through a black hole , we are sure to discover NEW and WEIRD UNIVERSES , Commander ..."
